  "not_covered": {
    "comment": "Boundaries, written down so nobody mistakes them for gaps.",
    "items": [
      "Settlement, checkout, card data, mandates, tax: the provider's rail (19.4, 1.3). The mesh records the fact and digest of agreement, never the legal content.",
      "Forwarding meter events to an external provider's ingestion API is an operator service; its mapping is not protocol surface.",
      "Whether the terms DOCUMENT behind terms_url changed is outside the digest (the URL is inside it): providers version terms URLs (19.1)."
    ]
  }
